<title>UK: Rolls, Airbus in A3XX engine pact.</title>
<headline>Rolls, Airbus in A3XX engine pact.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>British jet engine maker Rolls-Royce said on Monday it had signed a &quot;memorandum of understanding&quot; with the four-nation European Airbus consortium specifying its Trent 900 as the engine for the A3XX, Airbus's planned new large capacity airliner.</p>
</text>
